# sample.acl — minimal valid ChangeSet fixture for ail-cli integration tests
#
# ACL DSL format (ail-change::parser):
#   change <id>
#     author      <name>
#     description <text>          (optional)
#     base        <u64 snapshot-id>
#     op          <verb> [key=value ...]
#   end
#
# Op verbs map to ChangeSetOp variants by prefix:
#   create_* → Create, set_* → Set, add_* → Add,
#   remove_* | disconnect | delete → Remove,
#   connect → Connect, infer_* → Infer, verify → Verify
#
# Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.

change sample_fixture
author test-author
description sample fixture for CLI integration tests
base 0
op create_function id=fn.sample
end
